9. _1(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar_ ka-an-kam 
#tr.ts: išten šiqil kaspam kankam
#tr.en: (Concerning) the one shekel of sealed silver,

10. sza a-na ia-szi-im 
#tr.ts: ša ana iâšim
#tr.en: that to me

11. ta-ad-di-nam 
#tr.ts: taddinam
#tr.en: you gave,

